---
import GradientButton from "./GradientButton.astro";
import StoriesItems from "./StoriesItems.astro";
import logoStructia from "../assets/structia-logo.png";
---

<div class="hero container">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <img src={logoStructia.src} alt="Structia" class="hero-logo" />
    <h2 class="hero-headline">
      <span class="hero-line">
        <strong>Róbate legalmente</strong> la estrategia y el sistema que usan los referentes de flipping para facturar más que <strong>el 99 % del mercado</strong>.</span
      >
      <span class="hero-separator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="hero-subline"
        >Aprende el método que usan los flipperos que <strong>duplicaron su utilidad sin aumentar su carga de trabajo</strong>.</span
      >
      <span class="hero-line hero-cta"
        >Si sientes que ya sabes todo, no veas este video.</span
      >
    </h2>
    <div class="hero-video-placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="hero-video-placeholder-label">Video</span>
    </div>
    <GradientButton text="Agendar Auditoria" />
    <p class="hero-after-button">
      Las empresas de flipping más <strong>exitosas de México pasaron por aquí.</strong>
    </p>
    <div class="hero-stories">
      <StoriesItems />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
  }
  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .hero-logo {
    display: block;
    height: 1.5rem;
    width: auto;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .hero-headline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.3rem;
  }
  .hero-headline .hero-line:first-of-type {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    max-width: 100%;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .hero-headline .hero-subline {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    max-width: 100%;
    font-weight: 300;
  }
  .hero-headline .hero-cta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .hero-separator {
    display: block;
    width: 80%;
    max-width: 500px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #95a0d4, #ffffff);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-video-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 720px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    background: #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hero-video-placeholder-label {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }


  .hero :global(.gradient-button) {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .hero-after-button {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero-logo {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .hero-headline .hero-line:first-of-type {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      max-width: 45ch;
    }
    .hero-headline .hero-subline {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      max-width: 45ch;
    }
    .hero-headline .hero-cta {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .hero-after-button {
      font-size: 1.9rem;
    }
  }

  /* Estilos para las historias dentro del Hero */
  .hero-stories {
    width: 100%;
  }


  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero-stories {
    }

  }
</style>
